{#
  A structured index of this site for language models, per llmstxt.org: an H1,
  a blockquote summary, optional prose, then H2-delimited link lists.

  Everything comes from src/_data/site.js and the collections, so this file is
  never edited by hand and cannot drift from the site. The guides, blog and
  changelog blocks are gated on `sections` for the same reason the nav links
  are — a template with no posts must not advertise a page that was never
  written. Guides are listed individually rather than behind a single index
  link: a model answering "how do I do X" needs the guide titles to match on.

  `| safe` on every value because Nunjucks escapes for HTML by default, and an
  apostrophe rendered as &#39; in a plain-text file is just wrong.
-#}
